<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army is advancing in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile, while the Rapid Support Forces (RSF) and allied SPLM-N claim capture of multiple new locations in the Blue Nile region. RSF-led alliances report taking five additional areas in southeast Sudan and controlling sites such as Al-Madina 12 and Dering in the New Fung area of the Blue Nile. Simultaneously, widespread strikes on electricity stations have pushed the national power grid to the brink of collapse, and looted heritage sites are being targeted. The conflict has caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxONWNTSjRWTkpuQ0hnWEZtb3hDVWEyZFkwU0gtZFg5SWJvNDNkWl9taF81dU1GbVd4TDI3Z0R3N1NVZHI0S1hGeTJZS2JxblJfTlZ3czR2RVI0c1lTR01nUGE1T2hoR2tvdWRaeUZ4X1VyN1QxeWZrbXRzODRfTzk1NlQ5NHVrcUdWMEk0Znl6a0xOTTJYVDNLM1hDSG5uVXhaRUM4MQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQemNHWDV6ZlRZS0pBb3djbVRjMjFtci1sZ1VsSS0ySThHQUVlN2dHSmVCenZkd0xPWnJTUFowUldsckFzR2lBUzNCd0ladGg0bWZKQVBiMWpwNXJZc0hsZXRfekJDT2k1aXdSVzJockgzTHplRWlUcDNfRGRCakdqOG5tVW05TzJTOGxIRnd0YThqQXFaVzQ1ckE4TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBQZ19HdzRSdXcxS3BPWFdBQkhTNjl0azEwalFha2REdUZlWDVEcERuMlNYUUFLaGY0MGtzZC1WRjZnOTdHTWZ4VHZEYTZDV0VwbWFVQ1ZyVnotX3FOQUt2dS13MWdEUTJs?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1iejBCQkJiUU15bU90Z0k2cXIxeXd4NjNlcVNkNHNLbUprTjJMUmZFdVdfX29oVXJpY0ZpdTdxQ0YyNjJhdE41VE5nVjVwMDJo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNVXJNaWZ1QkFtcE5xRGIzbmx